<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Kimberly de Mexico cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Kimberly de Mexico cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said on Thursday it had cut its rating for Kimberly Clark de Mexico S.A. de C.V. to market perform from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
